             1|<br/>     2|Samantha Fong - 5 Stars<br/>     3|I had such a great reading with Atlas. It felt natural and conversational, and I really appreciated the way they wove in personal stories and intuitive insights along the way. The mix of tarot and oracle cards, centered around a focus I chose, made the reading feel especially aligned and meaningful. I’d definitely recommend them to anyone looking for a thoughtful, intuitive experience.<br/>     4|<br/>     5|Jessica Eggimann - 5 Stars<br/>     6|I have had the pleasure of experiencing a session with Atlas, twice now and I can honestly say it was a transformative experience. From the moment I walked into the space, I felt a warm and welcoming energy that immediately put me at ease. They are not only incredibly skilled in the art of Reiki but also possesses a genuine empathy that shines through in every interaction. During both sessions, they took the time to listen to my concerns, and met me where I was on my journey then created a tailored experience that addressed my specific needs. Their kindness and understanding made me feel truly seen and supported. I could feel the positive energy flow, and it brought a deep sense of comfort and healing that I've been seeking for some time. What stood out to me the most was Atlas’s ability to connect on a personal level, making the experience feel not just like a treatment, but like a true partnership in healing. I left feeling lighter, more balanced, and with a renewed sense of hope. If you’re looking for a compassionate and genuine healer who truly cares about your well-being, I wholeheartedly recommend them. It’s an experience that I believe everyone should have & look forward to my next session!
